{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_004BFE7A","title":"Staging Done for Mary Nyx","entry":"Dlg_004BFE7A::entry","exit":"Dlg_004BFE7A::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_4FF0E415","articyId":"72057791606425133","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mary-Nyx Curzona","text":"Ugh, must you stand so close? I can smell the streets on you. It's ruining my appetite.","speakerId":"Ntt_1672A850","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ugh, must you stand so close? I can smell the streets on you. It's ruining my appetite.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":75.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38414","byteOffset":28867208,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_59A3C94A","articyId":"72057791606425164","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mary-Nyx Curzona","text":"The health benefits were negligible. I take it you're here to annoy me about the apartment job?","speakerId":"Ntt_1672A850","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The health benefits were negligible. I take it you're here to annoy me about the apartment job?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":1000.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26092","byteOffset":17752096,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_831837A5","articyId":"72057791606425178","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mary-Nyx Curzona","text":"Yes, I watched your efforts on the surveillance monitors. The place looks dreadful. Insipid and uninspired. I'm sure the riff-raff will swoon.","speakerId":"Ntt_1672A850","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes, I watched your efforts on the surveillance monitors. The place looks dreadful. Insipid and uninspired. I'm sure the riff-raff will swoon.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":1561.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35605","byteOffset":27818952,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_62B4E461","articyId":"72057791606425185","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mary-Nyx Curzona","text":"I take it you're here to annoy me about that bothersome little apartment?","speakerId":"Ntt_1672A850","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I take it you're here to annoy me about that bothersome little apartment?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":1000.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30150","byteOffset":19285864,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_D83CE1DA","articyId":"72057791606425200","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mary-Nyx Curzona","text":"You are so very vulgar. Always talking about money.","speakerId":"Ntt_1672A850","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You are so very vulgar. Always talking about money.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":2135.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22823","byteOffset":16518504,"byteLength":396}},{"id":"DFr_18F9D9E4","articyId":"72057791606425231","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mary-Nyx Curzona","text":"Now you sound like a CEO. In some lights, if I squint very hard, you rather remind me of me.","speakerId":"Ntt_1672A850","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Now you sound like a CEO. In some lights, if I squint very hard, you rather remind me of me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3012.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35860","byteOffset":27913560,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_81489C11","articyId":"72057791606425238","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mary-Nyx Curzona","text":"Spoken like a true tradesperson. You will never be Spire-material with that demeanor.","speakerId":"Ntt_1672A850","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Spoken like a true tradesperson. You will never be Spire-material with that demeanor.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":3012.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41829","byteOffset":30152280,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_DAF044BD","articyId":"72057791606425269","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mary-Nyx Curzona","text":"204, actually. Diverting as this little tete-a-tete is, I'm busy. Take your pocket money and run along.","speakerId":"Ntt_1672A850","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"204, actually. Diverting as this little tete-a-tete is, I'm busy. Take your pocket money and run along.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3900.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45415","byteOffset":31514288,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_B21DCE7D","articyId":"72057791606425276","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mary-Nyx Curzona","text":"I forget how boring you are. Go on then, take your pocket money and scurry back to whatever hole you fester in.","speakerId":"Ntt_1672A850","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I forget how boring you are. Go on then, take your pocket money and scurry back to whatever hole you fester in.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":3900.0,"y"